<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a tsomi wa Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a tsomi wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peetelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a tsomi wa Peetelo, baasonihili nde huli baa Mukristo ba bali mu bitaanzi bitaanu bya Looma, bi bili hu Noode na hu Esete a tsi a Asiya. Tsi mo yiina bali mu uteele yo loloyi Turikiya. Bo bali mu utsahala huuna we byenyi, mu tooni ati, bo bali baa Mukristo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1">1.1</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:11">2.11</ref></char>). Tungi la bula libaapenye na libaanyasula bo. Bubaapfutaala bo mambu, peleve kaka, bubaakanina uvangila bo ma mabi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Peetelo li mu usonehe mu uhwadisa imiinu na hiitu bya bo, na uva bo ibahala mu udyata we baatu ba Nzambi hasoolo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a tsomi wa Peetelo, baasonihili huli baa Mukristo bakima ba baakasambila binza-nzambi bya pila mu pila. Bunuubu, bo bamiisobo mbili, mu tooni ati, bo baamiisa hiitu mu Yisu Kristo. Bo a bali mu ubwedyata we bakaaha ba bo, buuve we baatu ba tungi la bula ve (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:4">1.13–2.4</ref></char>). <char style="em">Bo baaka baatu ba Nzambi</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:4-10">2.4-10</ref></char>). Bo utwala ukama mutima mu mapasi na manzuhu mu tooni ati, bo bali na hiitu hi hili mu uva bo moonyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3">1.3</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 1:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 1:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:15">3.15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nzambi amiisuula Yisu Kristo mu lipfu: ni liina lili ibene hya hiitu hya baa Mukristo. Hiitu mo hiina, hibaabita mu usiinga bituhi na manzuhu we bu Yisu hasiidi. Yisu amoni pasi, baatuhi nde na baanyanzi nde. Nde a hafutili bubi mu bubi ve. Ka nde asiidi hiitu hya nde mu Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 4:12-19">4.12-19</ref></char>). Muhanda a tsomi wa Peetelo li mu usilasa maniima: moonyi na lipfu bya Yisu Kristo, bili ifwaani huli wa Mukristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ifwaani mo hinihi, hili mu umweese <char style="em">buni laafwana udyata na ba baavele baa Mukristo na mutso lipfuuta la baa Mukristo</char>. Muhanda li mu uva mandoongi huli baana ba libundu ba bali hu tsina lituma li bangoyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:18-3:6">2.18–3.6</ref></char>). Baatu bakima mu libundu aba basalili ba bakuutu bali bangoyi, na bakaasu ba balumi bali bangoyi. Mbiili a ba bali hu tsina lituma la bana, utwala usaangula huli bakuutu ba bo, hima hili imiinu hya wa Mukristo. Mutso libundu, batumi, bafudu na pasi inama hi libundu, bafwana umweese litondo na likiinzu la bana mu bana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-7">5.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:22-2:3">1.22–2.3</ref></char>). Mbiili mo yiina, yili mu umweese huli baa hu mbadi ti, a huli na tooni yi usyembe baa Mukristo ve.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Ni me Peetelo, iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo. Me ndi mu utsindaha muhanda mo wunuuwu, huli baa Nzambi hasoolo na ba baamiilalaana hu tsi bumwenyi, ba bali mu bitaanzi bya Pooti, Ngalatiya, Kapadosi, mu matsi ma Asiya, na Bitiniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Taata Nzambi atswamini usoolo benu, we bu huli matsimi ma nde. Nde miikitusa benu ibaandu hya ngidi, mu likumbasa li Livupu la nde. Nde hasiidi buuna, mana benu lisiingala Yisu Kristo, na makila ma nde ma maapuhimi matsyemese benu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Nyaha Nzambi ava benu hyese na hyenze bu hwafulala.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiitu hi liyobolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ba wu baasyeme Nzambi, Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo! Mu bunene bwa kwili a nde lingebe, nde amiiva bisu moonyi wu munyatihi, mu tsuuhili a Yisu Kristo ŋa hati la babaakwa. Nde hasiidi buuna, mana bisu liba na hiitu hi hili moonyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Tso bisu lili na hiitu mo hiina, bisu sa liyaka mukobe wu Nzambi hamiiswehele baatu ba nde. Mukobe mo wuuna wu buuveleduba, wu buuvelesa mbindu, ka nde afwana ukeelese umwedeme hwa nde. Nzambi amiiswehele benu nde hu mayulu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi li nga matwala. Nde ubaakeelese benu bubwe-bubwe mu imiinu hya benu mu Yisu Kristo. Tangu a tsukusu aka bebele, taangu yi Nzambi humweese liyobolo la benu.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ni mu buuna, tso mapasi ma pila mu pila mali mu umweese benu lingebe mu mwaana a taangu hole, benu laaluula mu kinya. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Mapasi mo maana, mali mu umweese imbuli hi imiinu hya benu. Wolo utwala ubiiya, ka bubaabwaha lo hu mbaahu, mu umono tso lo lili lilibwe. Ni bumosi kaka mu imiinu hya benu. Hyo hyafulala wolo talu, ka hyo kaka bubaalobese. Buukete imiinu hya benu mu umono tso hyo hili hihibwe. Titswene, ilumbu Yisu Kristo hu uyamonehele, benu sa liyaka muyusu, likiinzu na butsitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Benu laatondo Yisu, tso bu benu laavelemono nde. Benu libaasiila nde imiinu, tso bu benu laamaavelemono nde. Ni mu tooni imiinu hya benu mu nde, benu lili mu kinya yi yafulala, yi muyusu, yi bu uveletwala uyelemese. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Benu lili mu kinya mo yiina, mu tooni ati, mivumu mya benu sa miyoboho. Wuuna ni musyendo wu imiinu hya benu, mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Mimbihuli myasahi utsikaha mu bungeele bwosi, liyobolo mo liina. Myo myabihuli mu mamali mu utala hyese hi Nzambi haswehili benu. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Livupu la Kristo laaba mu bo, lo laayabisi bo manzuhu ma Kristo hu umono na muyusu wu uya humbisa a mo. Bo baasahi uyaba ki taangu na buni mo mu utwala uvangama. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Mambu ma Nzambi hayabisi bo ni maniima: maluumbi ma bo baakatoosele, a maba mu tooni a bo ve, ka mu tooni a benu. Bunuubu, ba bali mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, baatoosili benu maluumbi mo maana mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi, libaatsindihi umata hu yulu. Bapofi bo mwakulu kaka, bubaatondo uyaba mambu mo maana.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili bungidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ni mu buuna, vangamaani! Baani likanda! Saani hiitu hya benu hyoosi mu hyese hi Nzambi huva benu, ŋa Yisu Kristo huyamonehele. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Singalaani Nzambi bu benu lili baana ba nde. Na a likangama mu mapeyu ma mabi ma benu laaba na mo tsikulu ve, ŋa benu laaba kini hutso budimbu. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ka baani baatu bangidi mu mbiili a benu yoosi, we bu Nzambi wu ateele benu ali wa ngidi. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Ni mu buuna, Mabasonehe mali mu uleele: «Baani bangidi, mu tooni ti me ndi wa ngidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19.2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Mu masambulu ma benu, benu libaateele Nzambi: «Taata». Ni nde wuuna wu avelesa lisobosono la baatu. Ka nde ubaatsundasa pasi muutu mu mavaanga ma nde. Ni mu buuna, mu taangu yi yimiisaala benu mu uvyoso ŋa toto we byenyi, baani na boomo bwa Nzambi mu mbiili a benu. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Benu liyabi mu ki talu Nzambi hafuti mu uyobolo benu mu idiingu hi hyavele na tsongo. Ni mbiili yi yavyasaana yina, yi bakaaha ba benu baalongisi benu. Nzambi a hafuti yo mu biloho bi bibaabiya we mbongo na wolo ve. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Naana, Nzambi ayobili benu mu makila ma talu ma Kristo, ŋa baayehuli na baadubi nde we mwaana limeme li lavele ipiha na toodi, li baaviidi bungodu huli Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Nzambi asooli nde tswamina pangili a tsi, na mu libwe la benu, nde ayabisi benu Kristo mu taangu mo ya tsyelele yi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Mu nde benu lili mu usa imiinu mu Nzambi wu asuula nde ŋa hati la babaakwa, na wu ava nde muyusu. Ni mu buuna, benu libaasa imiinu na hiitu mu Nzambi.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Benu limiitsyeme bu benu limiisiingala imbuli, limiitondosono hwavele muwala. Ni mu buuna, tondosonwani mu mifudi na mu mutima mumosi. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Baamiibuta benu buta li linyatihi. A mu muhunu wu ubaakwa ve, ka mu muhunu wu avelekwa. Muhunu mo wuuna, ni mambu ma Nzambi ma moonyi, ma bilima na bilima. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Mu tooni ati, baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">«Baatu boosi bali we himbu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">na muyusu a bo li we ifulu hi matsyehe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Bu himbu himiikanya, ifulu himiibwa,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ka mambu ma Pfumu mu baakwilala taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Esa 40.6-8</ref> </char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Mambu mo ni Musamu wu Mubwe wu baayabisi benu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, siisaani mambu moosi mamabi. Nyahaani mapfuta, muwala, nyengi, na makusa mu bana. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Benu lili we baana ba bamiibuta. Sahaani mambu ma Nzambi ma mbuli, we bu mwaana ubaasaha unywa mabeelo ma ngu a nde. Mana mu mo, benu likula na liyaka liyobolo. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Mu tooni ati, baasonehe: «Benu laamoni buni Pfumu ali wu mubwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:9">Mkg 34.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu manya li itungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Yasusahani huli Pfumu Yisu, nde wu li manya la moonyi, li baatu baabumi, ka Nzambi amiisoolo lo la talu. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Na benu mwakulu, we mamanya ma moonyi, kuukamaani mu utuunga nzo Livupu. Kuukamaani mu uvanga kabu li bangaanga ba Nzambi banga lehemene, baa bu uba na isalu hi ubaayeholo bungodu bu Livupu. Bungodu mo buuna, Nzambi usiinga bwo, mu tooni a Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Eye, mu Libuuku la Ngidi baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">«Me utsusa mu musyenge a Syoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">manya li itungu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Me amiitsoolo lo la talu yindahi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Pasi muutu wu usa hiitu hya nde mu lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">a hutwala umono tsonyi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Esa 28.16</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Manya mo, libaava butsitu huli benu baa lili mu usa imiinu mu lo. Ka huli ba bali mu uvelesa imiinu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">«Manya li batungi baatiimbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">laamikituha manya la ngu ŋa itungu hya nzo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mkg 118.22</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Baabwesonehe bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">«Lo lili manya li libaakubasa baatu baku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">Lo lili manya li libaabwisa baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Esa 8.14</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Tso baatu bubaakuba baku mu lo, mu tooni ati, bo bubaabisa usa imiinu mu mambu ma Nzambi. Maana ni ma mu uyiila bo.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ka benu, benu lili ibaandu hibaasoolo, buli li bangaanga ba Nzambi baa Pfumu, buli li laatsyeme. Tso Nzambi hamiibaha benu, ni mu tooni ati, benu liyabisa mavaanga ma maasyenoho. Nzambi hapalisi benu mu piipidi, natee mu ukotese benu hutso liyalala la nde la kimuhili. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Tsomi, benu a laabeedi ibaandu ve. Ka bunuubu, benu lika ibaandu hya Nzambi. Benu baa laaveliyaka kwili lingebe, ka bunuubu Nzambi miikwila benu lingebe.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili musalili a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Bambaahi ba me baa litondo, benu lili bapyohi-nzila na byenyi ŋa toto mo yiniiyi. Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upondo benu dyaambu limosi: siisaani mapeyu ma musunya. Mapeyu mo maana mu baalwanisa idiingu hya benu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Baani na mbiili yimbwe ŋa hati li bangoyi. Tso bo bakesi benu ti benu bavangi baa ma mabi, bo sa bamono mbiili a benu yimbwe. Na bo sa bayusa Nzambi ilumbu hi nde hu uyamonehele.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Mu tooni a Pfumu, baakiinzaani batumi boosi: huli mutumi a tsi wu li na lituma ŋa yulu a baatu boosi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />na huli biduuka bya nde. Bo bali na isalu hi usyembe bavangi baa ma mabi, na ubaasilasa bavangi baa ma mabwe. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Nzambi tondi ti benu livaanga ma mabwe. Benu livaanga buuna, benu lu udibuha minywa mi bitsuudu bi byaveleyaba ma bo bu ubaasa. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Baadyataani we baatu ba bamiipala mu buviha. Ka bu benu laamiipala mu buviha, a litsima ti benu utwala uswehe mavaanga ma benu ma mabi ve. Ka baani baviha baa Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Baakiinzaani baatu boosi, baatondwaani baana ba ngu baa benu baa imiinu, baabaani na boomo bwa Nzambi, baakiinzaani mutumi a tsi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukami ŋa busu bu mapasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Benu basalili, baani na lisiingala na butsitu bwosi ŋa busu bu bapfumu ba benu. A lisiingala ndulu bapfumu ba bali ba babwe na bulembo ve, ka baasiingalaani napa ba bali na mutima wu munono. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ka huli bubwe tso muutu li mu ukunda mapasi ma bali mu usiila nde hwavele a dyaambu, bu nde ali mu usiingala Nzambi.<verse eid="1PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ki musyendo li, mu ukunda bikooti bi bali mu utete we, humbisa a hu we miisa dyaambu lilibi? Tso we li mu ukunda byo mu tooni a mambu ma mabwe ma we miivanga, huli bubwe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ni muliina Nzambi hateele benu, mu tooni ati, Kristo nde mwakulu amoni pasi mu benu. Nde asiisala benu ifwaani mana benu liduukala bondo la nde. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Mu Libuuku la Ngidi baasonehe: «Nde a hasiidi lisumu ve; dyaambu tso limosi li upfuta a laapali mu munywa a nde ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Esa 53.9</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ŋa baatuhi nde, nde a hafutili bituhi ve; ŋa baamweesi nde pasi, nde a hasahi ulwaana ve. Ka nde asuusi myosi ŋa myoho mya Nzambi wu ubaatsundasa baatu na butsiitsa. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />«Nde abiti nde mwakulu masumu ma bisu», mu nyutu a nde ŋa muti. Nde hasiidi buuna, mana bisu liba we baatu babaakwa ŋa busu bu masumu, na ubaha moonyi mu ukuhasa butsiitsa. Eeye, basonehe ti: «Ni mu tooni a mbuma a nde benu laabeloho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Esa 53.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Mu tooni ati, benu laabeedi we «mameme ma maadimbala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Esa 53.6</ref></char></note>». Ka bunuubu, benu limiifutaha huli Mubungili a benu, na Keedi mivumu mya benu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Itwadi hi bakadi na balumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ni bumosi kaka, benu bakaasu, baani na lisiingala ŋa busu bu balumi baa benu. Tso lisiidi buuna, uba ti na babahala ŋa hati la bo ba bali mu uvelesa imiinu mu Mambu ma Nzambi, babaha imiinu mu mbiili bakadi ba bo. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Bo bu ubaha imiinu, bu bo bali mu umono mbiili a benu ya ngidi yi likiinzu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />A lisaha uba yoli-yoli mu nyutu mu pandili a naanga a benu, mu bilabu bya wolo, buuve mu bikutu bi byafulala bubwe ve. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ka yoli-yoli a nyutu a benu, yafwana uba ya hutso mutima. Ni yoli-yoli yi yuvelebiya, yi livupu li bulembo na la hyenze. Ni liina lili la talu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ni buuna hutsomi, bakaasu bangidi ba baakasa hiitu mu Nzambi, baakamweese yoli-yoli a bo. Bo baakasiingala balumi ba bo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />We ifwaani hya Sara wu akasiingala Abrahami, akateele nde «pfumu a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Mba 18.12</ref></char></note>». Bunuubu, benu laaka baana ba nde, tso benu lili mu uvanga mambu ma mabwe, hwavele a boomo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Benu balumi kaka, bu benu lili mu utsahala na bakadi baa benu, yaabaani ti bo a bali na mifudi ve. Ka baakiinzaani bo, mu tooni ati, itwadi na benu, bo bu ubaha bungodu bwa moonyi wu umata huli Nzambi. Benu lisa buuna, dyaambu tso limosi a lu usa ikahu mu masambulu ma benu ve.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvanga libwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ni mu buuna, baani benu boosi matsimi mamosi. Baani na kwili lingebe mu bana, na bulembo, na litondo li mutima na kulimini. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />A lifutala lilibi mu lilibi ve, tso ituhi mu ituhi ve. Ka futalaani bunuubu: «Nyaha Nzambi asyeme benu!» Mu tooni ati, ni muliina Nzambi hateele benu, mana benu liyaka lisyeme. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Mabasonehe ni maniima:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">«Muutu wu utondi uba na idiingu hi ibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">na umono bilumbu bya kinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">nde afwana ubaavelekusa na ubaavelepfuta.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Nde afwana ubaatahuha na bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">nde afwana ubaavanga ma mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">na nde afwana ubaasaha hyenze taangu yoosi.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Mu tooni ati, miisu ma Pfumu mali taangu yoosi ŋa yulu a baatu babaasungama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">na matswi ma nde mali bwasi mu ubaayuha masambulu ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">ka Pfumu ubaabisa baa bubaavaanga lilibi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:13-17">Mkg 34.13-17</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiitu ŋa busu bu malobese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Na utwala uvangila benu libi, tso benu laahwada mu ubaavanga libwe? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Tso benu lili mu umono pasi mu tooni a ma mabwe ma benu lili mu uvanga, baani mu kinya! Mu tooni ati, baasonehe: «A liba na boomo bwa baatu ba bu utwala uvangila benu libi ve, na a liheleene mitima ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Esa 8.12-13</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ka baayusaani Kristo mu mitima mya benu we Pfumu a benu wa Ngidi. Baavangamaani mu ubaakala linyutu la benu, ŋa busu bwa ba bali mu ufuula benu tooni a hiitu hya benu. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Baasaani buuna na bulembo na likiinzu. Babaani na matsimi ma maatsyeme, mana ba bali mu ukusa benu mu ndyatili a benu yimbwe ya baa Mukristo, bakwa tsonyi mu makusa ma bo. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Tso liina ni litondo la Nzambi, hwafulala bubwe mu umono pasi mu uvanga lilibwe, ka a mu uvanga ma mabi ve.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifwaani hya Kristo mu mapasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ka Kristo nde mwakulu amoni pasi ya nzyeni, mu tooni masumu ma baatu. Nde wa tsiitsa, mu babaaveletsiitsa, mu ubita benu huli Nzambi. Baadubi nde mu linyutu, ka Nzambi asuuli nde mu Livupu. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Mu matwala ma Livupu mo liina, nde ayalongese te mavupu ma maaba hutso a kondaayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mavupu ma maaba hutso a kondaayi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mavupu ma maakatumbaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na ma mali mu ukeele tsundusu a mo.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Ni mavupu ma maabisi usiingala nde mu taangu a tsikulu, ŋa Nzambi hakakeele na mukami, bilumbu bi Nowa hatungi likuumbi la nzali. Mwana a baatu pwombo baakoti hutso likuumbi mo liina na baafuuhi mu mamba. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Mamba mo maana aba ni ifwaani hya tondihili yi yili mu ufuuhasa benu taangu yi. Tondihili mo, a yili mu uswaha mbiindu a nyutu a benu ve. Ka ni mu usobo mbiili ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu matsimi ma maatsyeme. Tondihili yili mu ufuuhasa benu, mu tooni ati Yisu Kristo asuuhi mu babaakwa. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Nde wu ayeni hu yulu, na wu li ŋa mbahala a Nzambi, hu nde ali mu utuma bapofi, na bipfumu bikima, na matwala ma hu yulu.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Usobo mbiili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Bu Kristo hamoni pasi mu musunya a nde, benu kaka, vangamaani bumosi we nde. Mu tooni ati, wu miimono pasi mu musunya a nde, miitahuha na masumu. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Mu taangu yi yimiisaala benu ŋa toto, a hwafwana ti benu libaadyata we bu huli mapeyu ma musunya ve, ka dyataani we bu huli litondo la Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Hutsomi, benu laavyosi taangu yindahi, mu ubaasa mavaanga ma mu baava kinya huli ba baaveleyaba Nzambi. Benu laavahuli linyutu la benu mu bumbembo, mu mapeyu ma musunya, mu malaangi, mu mikungi mi udya na unywa, na ubaasambila bifwita. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Bunuubu, ba baaveleyaba Nzambi, bali mu ukimuha bu benu laabwevelepfutana na bo hutso a mbiili bumbembo yi yalendolo iteesi. Isalu hya bo aka ubaatuha benu. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ka bo bu uva ikuumbu huli wu amiivangama mu utsundasa bamoonyi na babaakwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ni mu buuna, Yisu hayabisi Musamu wu Mubwe pa huli babaakwa. Humbisa uyaka tsundusu yi musunya we bu huli litondo la baatu, bo bu uba moonyi mu Livupu, we bu huli litondo la Nzambi.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsalili bungodu bwa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Tsukusu a tsi yika bebele. Ni mu buuna, baabaani na mbiili ya tsiki na likanda, mana benu libaatwala usambila. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Hati a tsomi, baatondosonwani mu mifudi, mu tooni ati, litondo libaafuha masumu ma malahi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Baayakasanaani mu manzo ma benu, hwavele uŋono. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Pasi muutu ŋa hati la benu, abaasalila bungodu bu Nzambi hava nde mu ukumbasa bana. Baasaani buuna, mana benu liba bakeelisi bababwe, baa hyese hi hilahi hya Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Tso muutu li na bungodu bu utoyo, nde afwana uyabisa Mambu ma Nzambi. Tso muutu li na bungodu bu usalisa bambaahi, nde afwana usalila bwo na mifudi mi Nzambi ubaava nde. Saani buuna mana mu moosi, Nzambi ayaka muyusu mu Yisu Kristo, mu nde huli na muyusu na matwala mu bilima na bilima. Ameni!<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapasi ma wa Mukristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Bambaahi baa litondo, a likimuha bu lili hutso muvitu malobese ve. A latsima ti dyaambu la kimuhili li lili mu uyila benu. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ka baabaani na kinya bu lili mu umono mapasi ma Kristo hamoni, mana benu ka liluula mu kinya yindahi ŋa nde hu umonehele mu muyusu a nde huli baatu boosi. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ni kinya huli benu tso baatu bali mu utuha benu bu lili bayihi ba Kristo. Mu tooni ati, Livupu la Nzambi li muyusu, lili na benu. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />A batsundasa tso mumosi ŋa hati la benu bu nde ali mudubi ve, muyibi, muvaangi a ma mabi, buuve mukoti a mu mambu ma bangani. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ka tso bali mu utsundasa muutu mu tooni ati nde li wa Mukristo, nde anyaha umono tsonyi. Nyaha muutu mo wuuna abaafutala Nzambi matondo, bu bali mu uteele nde wa Mukristo. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Tangu yimiito yi tsundusu yi ubaandiha. Hati a tsomi, bu umaatsundasa ibaandu hya Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ibaandu hya Nzambi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">buuve nzo a Nzambi. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 9:6">Ezk 9.6</ref></char>.</note>. Ka tso tsundusu yibandihi mu bisu baatu ba Nzambi, buni tsukusu yi uba, ŋa tsundusu yi ubwa ŋa yulu a ba bali mu uvelesa hiitu mu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Nzambi? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />We bu Mabasonehe mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">«Tso hu li pasi mu mutsiitsa mu uyoboho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">sa ufula pasi mu nga mavaanga ma mabi na mu nga masumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Mak 11.31</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ni mu buuna, nyaha ba bali mu umono pasi we bu hu li litondo la Nzambi, babaahwada mu ubaasa mavaanga ma mabwe. Bo baafwana ubaayeholo idiingu hya bo huli Muvaangi a bo, wu li wu akuha mu manzuhisini ma nde.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi huli bakuutu ba libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Bunuubu, me ndi mu ukwadisa bakuutu ba libundu ba bali ŋa hati la benu. Me kaka wu ndi mukuutu libundu we bo. Me ndi mbangi mapasi ma Kristo hamoni, na me tsambaha kaka kabu mu muyusu wu uya. Me ndi mu upondo bo mambu mo maniima: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Baakeelesaani konge mameme yi Nzambi hava benu we bakeedi. Bakeelesaani yo, a hwati mu kwamisa ve, ka mu mutima wu ayaluha, we bu hu li litondo la Nzambi. Baasaani buuna hwavele a nzala a kaluha, ka mu tooni lisiingala. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />A lisaha unangimana ba baasuusa hutso lituma la benu ve. Ka baani na mbiili yimbwe ŋa busu bwa konge mameme, mana mo madukala ifwaani hya benu. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Na ŋa Mukuutu babungili hu uyamonehele, benu lu uyaka mutata a muyusu, wu uvelebiya.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Ni bumosi kaka, benu pfudu-mbahala, baani hu tsina lituma la ba baakulala benu. Na benu boosi, lwataani kulimini mu itwadi hya benu. Mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe mali mu uleele ti: «Nzambi ubaatelemene banga likwayi, ka nde ubava hyese hya nde huli banga a kulimini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Mak 3.34</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ni mu buuna, baandamaani na bulembo hu tsina a hoho hwa Nzambi hu matwala, mana nde asyenolo benu mu taangu yi nde hakese. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Yeholwaani nde mapasi ma benu moosi, mu tooni ati nde ubaakeelese benu.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Kutaani linyutu! Baani likanda! Mu tooni ati muboho a benu, Mukuyi li mu uvyana we kosi, wu li mu usiinga na ubaasaha wu nde hu umbyasa. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Telemenaani nde na kangamaani mu Nzambi. Yaabaani ti, mapasi mo maniima, bali mu umweese mo kaka huli baana ba ngu a benu mu tsi yoosi. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Benu sa libwemono pasi mwaana a taangu hoole. Ka Nzambi wu ubaamweese hyese hya nde hyoosi, amiiteele benu mu ukoto hutso muyusu a nde wu bilima na bilima, mu itwadi hya na Yisu Kristo. Nde mwakulu sa atelemese benu, nde sa ahwadisa benu, sa ava benu mifudi, nde sa asusa benu ŋa yulu ibeene hi hyavangama. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Nyaha matwala maba mu nde mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsukusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Me atsonihili benu muhanda mo wunuuwu wu mukusi, mu likumbasa la Silaasi wu me umbaapolo we mwaana a ngu a me wu akuha mu imiinu. Me atsonihi nde, mu uhwadisa benu, na mu usilasa ti, benu hutso a hyese hya Nzambi laakangama. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Libundu la Nzambi li lili huni, hu musyenge a Babylooni, na li Nzambi hasoolo we benu, litsindihi benu mabwehe. Ni bumosi kaka, Malako mwaana a me, tsindihi benu mabwehe. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Baavaani mabwehe ma ubumbasana mu litondo li bumwana bu bungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Nyaha hyenze hiba na benu boosi ba lili mu Kristo!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>